{"id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-finite-subset.md","title":"Finite Subset","display":"df-finite-subset — Finite Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-finite-subset","aliases":["93-df-finite-subset"],"display":"df-finite-subset — Finite Subset","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-finite-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-finite-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-subset — Finite Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span> is a set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span> is the finite-set predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}subset}\\vdash [A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(x)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}subset}\\vdash [A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(x)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开